3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}+1 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}+I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(A)={A}^{2}+I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${A}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(A):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & ={A}^{2}+I \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1+1 & 0+0 \\\\ 0+0 & -1+1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186365538 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115230 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating a Matrix Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b2de13f-7428-5cf4-a15d-bb759547b2ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365540}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b2de13f-7428-5cf4-a15d-bb759547b2ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365540} :answer-field/id #uuid "11f8211f-fddf-5d62-b133-32198e03aa6f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365539} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ea4d763-c8fb-5f15-8550-82d38c91fb41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/val